    <value>For listening to music only: when the station you are listening to starts an ad break or someone talks, zap to the highest favorite that is playing a song, and zap back once it plays music again. Never in the middle of a song, though: the return waits until the station you landed on reaches its own break. Stations that do not mark their ads are assumed to be in an ad break when a song runs well past its length and speech is heard instead of music.</value>
