  <data name="ShortcutsText.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>In the window: Ctrl+Space to stop or play, Ctrl+M to mute, Ctrl+F to search. The play, pause and next buttons of the Windows volume flyout, the lock screen, your media keys and your headset work too, where next and previous move through the favorites.</value>
